  ('52423252335', 'Star Duo Forms ‘Fingerprint’ in Space, NASA’s Webb Finds', 'These cosmic “tree rings” tell a story written by the stars. Every 8 years, the two stars in this image are brought together by their orbits — creating colliding streams of gas that, under the right c', '2022-08-05T17:20:42', 7, 'https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/52423252335_bd751bb02f_o.jpg'),
