  ('52621978298', 'NASA’s Webb Uncovers Star Formation in Cluster’s Dusty Ribbons, NGC 346 (NIRCam)', 'What was star formation like in the early universe? One way to study conditions in the distant past is to find parallels close by. That''s why Webb took a look at star-forming region NGC 346 within our', '2023-01-11T15:15:19', 7, 'https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/52621978298_3b39513823_o.png'),
  ('52622955246', 'New Webb Image Reveals Dusty Disk Like Never Seen Before', 'You’re blocked! 🚫 To see the dusty disk around a young star, Webb blocked out starlight using a coronagraph, or mask. This is the first time that this disk, made of leftover debris from planet formati', '2023-01-12T10:52:10', 7, 'https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/52622955246_d2265e6f2a_o.png'),
