  ('53988033154', '#UnfoldTheUniverse art - by  Julia Curylo', 'An addition to our #UnfoldTheUniverse social media campaign by Julia Curylo. Julia says, &quot;The two paintings I am sending are dedicated to the Webb Telescope. They feature a motif inspired by its ', '2024-03-25T16:13:16', 11, 'https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/53988033154_e9e67dd49a_o.jpg'),
  ('53988134340', '#UnfoldTheUniverse art - by Holly Streekstra', 'An addition to our #UnfoldTheUniverse social media campaign by Holly Streekstra. Holly says, &quot;I currently have an exhibition up at the Kolman and Reeb Gallery in Minneapolis. The gallery awarded ', '2024-08-01T20:49:24', 11, 'https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/53988134340_028f8c1c28_o.jpg'),
  ('53989393312', 'Webb Model by Sherwyn Dias', 'This Webb model was submitted by Sherwyn Dias. Sherwyn says, &quot;On 24 January this year, our school had organized a one-day science exhibition comprising different models based on important scienti', '2024-09-12T14:02:05', 11, 'https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/53989393312_de55ecdbcc_o.jpg'),
  ('53989453402', '#JWSTArt - Louise Perreaudin for ArianeGroup', 'A submission to our #JWSTArt social media campaign. This illustration was created by Louise Perreaudin for ArianeGroup. Webb was launched on an ArianeSpace Ariane 5 rocket. This art is from their <a h', '2024-09-12T14:26:34', 9, 'https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/53989453402_d05a4ba39e_o.png'),
  ('53989782746', 'NASA''s Webb Peers into the Extreme Outer Galaxy (NIRCam and MIRI)', 'Here’s Webb’s look at the Digel Clouds, an outpost of star-formation located in the Milky Way’s “outer rim.” ✨ Webb’s sharp infrared eye captured activity within star clusters in these molecular cloud', '2024-09-12T10:03:28', 4, 'https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/53989782746_542708d9e9_o.png'),
  ('53990351826', '#JWSTArt - Louise Perreaudin for ArianeGroup', 'A submission to our #JWSTArt social media campaign. This illustration was created by Louise Perreaudin for ArianeGroup. Webb was launched on an ArianeSpace Ariane 5 rocket. This art is from their <a h', '2024-09-12T14:26:31', 9, 'https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/53990351826_4190af399c_o.png'),
  ('53990351881', '#JWSTArt - Louise Perreaudin for ArianeGroup', 'A submission to our #JWSTArt social media campaign. This illustration was created by Louise Perreaudin for ArianeGroup. Webb was launched on an ArianeSpace Ariane 5 rocket. This art is from their <a h', '2024-09-12T14:26:32', 9, 'https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/53990351881_d4506977b0_o.png'),
  ('53990587098', '#JWSTArt - Louise Perreaudin for ArianeGroup', 'A submission to our #JWSTArt social media campaign. This illustration was created by Louise Perreaudin for ArianeGroup. Webb was launched on an ArianeSpace Ariane 5 rocket. This art is from their <a h', '2024-09-12T14:26:32', 9, 'https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/53990587098_46b4f6037b_o.png'),
  ('54003266552', 'Arp 107 (MIRI Image)', 'This image of Arp 107, shown by Webb’s MIRI (Mid-Infrared Instrument), reveals the supermassive black hole that lies in the center of the large spiral galaxy to the right. This black hole, which pulls', '2024-09-18T10:05:00', 4, 'https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/54003266552_3c5a1072a3_o.png'),
  ('54004498744', 'Arp 107 (NIRCam Image)', 'This image of Arp 107, shown by Webb’s NIRCam (Near Infrared Camera) shows older stars, which shine brightly in both galaxies, as well as the tenuous gas bridge that runs between them. The vibrant bac', '2024-09-18T10:04:23', 4, 'https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/54004498744_15b4f11d3f_o.png'),
  ('54004594840', 'Webb Provides Another Look Into Galactic Collisions (NIRCam and MIRI)', 'On Wednesdays we wear pink. 💖 Arp 107, an interacting galaxy pair, was captured by Webb in both the near and mid-infrared. What does each infrared wavelength tell us? Webb’s mid-infrared observations ', '2024-09-18T10:04:10', 4, 'https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/54004594840_9758559235_o.png'),
  ('54008259247', '1000 Days in Space for Webb', 'Today is Webb’s 1000th day in space! 🎉 Our #UnfoldTheUniverse &quot;Lifer&quot; checklist: -A spacecraft impacting a moving asteroid -Dust in unexpected places, from supernova remnants to early galaxi', '2024-09-20T14:44:21', 7, 'https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/54008259247_3014ec52b6_o.png'),
  ('54020848281', 'Galaxy GS-NDG-9422 Spectrum (NIRSpec)', 'Is this the missing link? 🔎 Webb spotted an unusual early universe galaxy (1 billion years after the big bang) containing gas clouds that outshine its stars. Hotter and more massive stars than we see ', '2024-09-25T10:51:34', 11, 'https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/54020848281_dbc3eb2934_o.png'),
  ('54021078893', 'In Odd Galaxy, NASA’s Webb Finds Potential Missing Link to First Stars', 'Is this the missing link? 🔎 Webb spotted an unusual early universe galaxy (1 billion years after the big bang) containing gas clouds that outshine its stars. Hotter and more massive stars than we see ', '2024-09-25T10:49:09', 7, 'https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/54021078893_e6742de75a_o.png'),
  ('54034385932', 'Webb Researchers Discover Lensed Supernova, Confirm Hubble Tension', 'A New H0pe? Scientists are using Webb to measure the expansion of the universe, by pointing it at a gravitationally lensed supernova SN H0pe. The light from this exploding star has been bent and magni', '2024-10-01T11:18:15', 11, 'https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/54034385932_189f1e8027_o.png'),
  ('54036683102', 'Centaur 29P Outgassing (NIRSpec)', 'NASA’s James Webb Space Telescope observed Centaur 29P/Schwassmann-Wachmann 1, one of the most active objects in the outer solar system. Centaurs are “hybrid” objects in the sense that they share char', '2024-10-02T10:10:14', 7, 'https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/54036683102_bc879dfa7a_o.png'),
  ('54037867034', 'NASA''s Webb Reveals Unusual Jets of Volatile Gas from Icy Centaur 29P (Artist''s Concept)', 'Centaurs are objects in orbital flux: small and icy, pushed inward of Neptune by its gravity, not quite comets...yet. Webb mapped gases spewing from Centaur 29P in high detail, providing new insights ', '2024-10-02T10:08:45', 7, 'https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/54037867034_fd0c8718fd_o.png'),
  ('54043097600', 'The Exotic Stellar Population of Westerlund 1 (NIRCam)', 'Imagine a sky full of hundreds of stars as bright as the full moon… If our solar system were a part of this “super star” cluster, that is what we might experience. Here is Webb’s look at Westerlund 1,', '2024-10-04T10:00:00', 10, 'https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/54043097600_8a7e2a73f2_o.jpg'),
  ('54049989994', '#UnfoldTheUniverse art - by Felicia Tsung', 'An addition to our #UnfoldTheUniverse social media campaign by Felicia Tsung (@fctembroidery. This is hand embroidery of the Tarantula Nebula on a 4&quot; hoop. If you create art inspired by the James', '2024-09-15T14:18:10', 11, 'https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/54049989994_eb40fbdd67_o.jpg'),
  ('54082928741', 'James Webb Space Telescope Pumpkin Carving - by Brad Tippett', 'Did you carve a NASA Webb pumpkin? Send us pictures! Email us at GSFC-NASAwebb@mail.nasa.gov! For next year, you can download 4 different carving patterns here: <a href="https://jwst.nasa.gov/content/', '2024-10-21T10:42:59', 7, 'https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/54082928741_34eb79a4da_o.jpg'),
  ('54088897300', 'Webb finds candidates for first young brown dwarfs outside the Milky Way', 'It’s giving rainbows and unicorns, like a middle school binder 🌈 Meet NGC 602, a young star cluster in the Small Magellanic Cloud (one of our satellite galaxies), where astronomers using @NASAWebb hav', '2024-10-23T13:38:20', 9, 'https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/54088897300_3e378b6a5f_o.png'),
  ('54102426319', 'Catching the edge of the phantom galaxy (NIRCam and MIRI image)', 'The eerie eye of a Phantom in the sky… Here’s an updated look at M74, also known as the Phantom Galaxy. New Webb data is allowing scientists a better outlook at its stellar nurseries. <a href="https:/', '2024-10-29T07:39:28', 4, 'https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/54102426319_9af09725b5_o.png'),
  ('54107019161', 'Galaxies IC 2163 and NGC 2207 (Hubble and Webb Images Side by Side)', 'These are two views of spiral galaxies IC 2163 and NGC 2207. NASA’s Hubble Space Telescope’s ultraviolet- and visible-light view is at left, and the agency’s James Webb Space Telescope’s mid-infrared ', '2024-10-31T10:05:58', 4, 'https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/54107019161_1a20b294e2_o.png'),
  ('54107357754', 'NASA’s Webb, Hubble Examine Galaxy Pair', 'I always feel like somebody’s watching me 👀 Happy Halloween from @NASAWebb and @NASAHubble! This terrifying new image combines data from both telescopes, unveiling a scary pair of “eyes” in space. The', '2024-10-31T10:05:44', 4, 'https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/54107357754_d57a5943c5_o.png'),
  ('54107470055', 'Galaxies IC 2163 and NGC 2207 (MIRI Image)', 'This mid-infrared image from NASA’s James Webb Space Telescope excels at showing where the cold dust, set off in white, glows throughout these two galaxies, IC 2163 and NGC 2207. The telescope also he', '2024-10-31T10:06:16', 4, 'https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/54107470055_7387a886d1_o.png'),
  ('54163774891', 'Hats Off to NASA''s Webb: Sombrero Galaxy Dazzles in New Image (MIRI)', 'Ring around the galaxy… Here’s Webb’s stunning new mid-infrared image of M104. This bright core of the galaxy is dim in this view (the first slide), revealing a smooth inner disk as well as details of', '2024-11-25T11:01:36', 4, 'https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/54163774891_9c523ea092_o.png'),
  ('54164228360', 'Sombrero Galaxy (Hubble and Webb Image)', 'This image compares the view of the famous Sombrero Galaxy in mid-infrared light (top) and visible light (bottom). The James Webb Space Telescope’s MIRI (Mid-Infrared Instrument) reveals the smooth in', '2024-11-25T11:01:44', 4, 'https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/54164228360_749c29f72a_o.png'),
  ('54167157727', 'Tracing spiral arms in infrared', 'Pardon our dust! Webb’s near and mid-infrared view of spiral galaxy NGC 2090 highlights its two winding arms as well as the beautiful details of its swirls of dust and gas. In visible light, the arms ', '2024-11-27T10:00:00', 4, 'https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/54167157727_9c8df56be1_o.jpg'),
  ('54183500660', 'Webb finds surprises in Spiderweb protocluster field', 'Webb and the Spiderweb protocluster? Let’s get stuck in! 👇 What is it? A galaxy cluster in formation, 10 billion light years away, composed of more than 100 known galaxies. Webb has found some new one', '2024-12-04T15:00:00', 7, 'https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/54183500660_856c829657_o.jpg'),
  ('54198099268', 'Firefly Sparkle Galaxy and Companions in Galaxy Cluster MACS J1423 (NIRCam Image)', 'Webb discerned distinct star clusters in the Firefly Sparkle galaxy, which existed 600 million years after the big bang - the first discovery of an actively forming galaxy as lightweight as the young ', '2024-12-11T11:19:19', 5, 'https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/54198099268_eee90ccf25_o.png'),
