  ('55164516701', 'Webb Model by S.Harsikha', 'This Webb model was submitted by S.Harsikha. &quot;As part of a school science EXPO conducted on 9th February 2026, I built a model of the James Webb Space Telescope. I wanted to share it with you bec', '2026-03-23T15:33:20', 11, 'https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/55164516701_c1b68d5e40_o.jpg'),
  ('55164525971', 'Webb Model by Aarav Jain', 'This Webb model was submitted by 10-year-old Aarav Jain. Aarav says, &quot;I want to become a space scientist, study the universe and discover the unknown. James Web Space Telescope can contribute gre', '2026-03-23T15:39:01', 11, 'https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/55164525971_a5a2ee49ec_o.jpg'),
  ('55166139709', 'M90 (NGC 4569)', 'Is it just me or is that galaxy getting closer? 👀 M90 (NGC 4569), shown here in this new Webb image, is indeed getting closer! Over time, its orbit through the Virgo cluster has accelerated so much th', '2026-03-03T18:37:45', 4, 'https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/55166139709_f01e73843b_o.jpg'),
  ('55167267227', 'NASA Webb, Hubble Share Most Comprehensive View of Saturn to Date (Webb + Hubble)', 'Webb teamed up with NASA’s Hubble Space Telescope, observing the ringed planet in complementary wavelengths of light to give us a richer, more layered understanding of its atmosphere. This image was m', '2026-03-03T14:24:08', 11, 'https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/55167267227_7c8241e7dc_o.jpg'),
  ('55167269212', 'NASA Webb, Hubble Share Most Comprehensive View of Saturn to Date (NIRCam, Wide-View, Unlabeled)', 'Amaze amaze amaze! Webb teamed up with NASA’s Hubble Space Telescope, observing the ringed planet in complementary wavelengths of light to give us a richer, more layered understanding of its atmospher', '2026-03-25T14:04:57', 8, 'https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/55167269212_efb98e8714_o.png'),
  ('55168333153', 'NASA Webb, Hubble Share Most Comprehensive View of Saturn to Date (Webb + Hubble, Side-by-side)', 'Amaze, amaze, amaze! Webb teamed up with NASA’s Hubble Space Telescope, observing Saturn in complementary wavelengths of light to give us a richer, more layered understanding of its atmosphere. These ', '2026-03-25T14:04:20', 8, 'https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/55168333153_843971c589_o.png'),
  ('55168334028', 'NASA Webb, Hubble Share Most Comprehensive View of Saturn to Date (NIRCam, Labeled)', 'Webb teamed up with NASA’s Hubble Space Telescope, observing the ringed planet in complementary wavelengths of light to give us a richer, more layered understanding of its atmosphere. The Hubble image', '2026-03-25T14:04:48', 8, 'https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/55168334028_617fe76d7f_o.png'),
  ('55168334683', 'NASA Webb, Hubble Share Most Comprehensive View of Saturn to Date (NIRCam, Wide-view, Labeled)', 'Amaze amaze amaze! Webb teamed up with NASA’s Hubble Space Telescope, observing the ringed planet in complementary wavelengths of light to give us a richer, more layered understanding of its atmospher', '2026-03-25T14:05:07', 8, 'https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/55168334683_afbcdb2435_o.png'),
  ('55168418509', 'NASA Webb, Hubble Share Most Comprehensive View of Saturn to Date (NIRCam, unlabeled)', 'Webb teamed up with NASA’s Hubble Space Telescope, observing the ringed planet in complementary wavelengths of light to give us a richer, more layered understanding of its atmosphere. The Hubble image', '2026-03-25T14:04:37', 8, 'https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/55168418509_402527062a_o.png');
